<section class="hol-tool-shell hol-approved-tool"><header class="hol-tool-banner"><h1>Recovery</h1><small>{{name}}{{#if previewDying}} · Preview{{/if}}</small></header><div class="hol-tool-content">
<div class="hol-tool-stats"><span>HP <b>{{basis.hp}} / {{basis.maxHp}}</b></span><span>Grit <b>{{basis.gritAvailable}}</b></span><span>Wounds <b>{{wounds}}</b></span>{{#if character}}<span>Death marks <b>{{marks}}</b></span>{{/if}}</div>
<div class="hol-tool-grid"><section class="hol-tool-box"><h2>Restore HP</h2><div class="hol-tool-actions"><button type="button" class="hol-primary" data-action="operation" data-kind="heal">Healing</button><button type="button" data-action="quick" data-kind="breath">Safe breath</button>{{#if character}}<button type="button" data-action="operation" data-kind="grit">Spend Grit</button>{{/if}}</div><p>Safe breath restores HP. Wounds and spent Grit remain.</p><a href="#" data-hol-rule-path="design/rules/recovery.md">Read rules</a></section>
{{#if character}}<section class="hol-tool-box"><h2>Stabilization</h2><p>Clear death marks at 0 HP after the stabilization Maneuver.</p><div class="hol-tool-actions"><button type="button" data-action="previewDying">{{#if previewDying}}Exit preview{{else}}Preview Dying{{/if}}</button><button type="button" data-action="quick" data-kind="stabilize">Stabilize</button></div>{{#if previewDying}}<p class="hol-tool-result">Use Healing, Safe breath or Stabilize to explore this example. {{name}} stays unchanged until you exit the preview and record an actual recovery.</p>{{/if}}</section>{{/if}}</div>
{{#if notice}}<p class="hol-tool-result" role="status">{{notice}}</p>{{/if}}
{{#if operation}}<section class="hol-tool-box"><input type="hidden" name="kind" value="{{operation}}">{{#if healing}}<h2>Healing</h2><div class="hol-tool-fields"><label>Healing before Life resistance<input name="amount" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="6"></label><label>Additional Life resistance<input name="lifeResistance" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="0"></label></div><p>Automatic worn Life resistance: {{automaticLifeResistance}}. Highest matching resistance applies.</p>{{/if}}{{#if grit}}<h2>Spend 1 Grit</h2><p>Restore full HP and clear death marks. Wounds and scars remain.</p>{{/if}}
{{#if correction}}<h2>Correct health and survival</h2><p>Document an explicit correction. Existing pending wound records remain.</p><label>Correct HP<input name="hp" type="number" min="0" max="{{basis.maxHp}}" step="1" value="{{basis.hp}}"></label>{{#if character}}<label>Survival status<select name="status">{{#each statuses}}<option value="{{value}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{value}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label><div class="hol-tool-fields"><label>Accumulated wounds / scars<input name="wounds" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="{{wounds}}"></label><label>Death marks<input name="marks" type="number" min="0" max="3" step="1" value="{{marks}}"></label></div>{{/if}}{{/if}}
<label>Source note (optional)<input name="reason" type="text"></label><p class="hol-tool-result" data-preview aria-live="polite"></p><button type="button" data-action="apply" class="hol-primary">Apply recovery</button></section>{{/if}}
{{#if character}}<section class="hol-tool-box"><h2>Wounds & scars</h2><table class="hol-tool-wounds"><thead><tr><th>Scar / injury</th><th>Effects</th><th>Recovery</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>{{#each records}}<tr><td>{{injury}}</td><td>{{effectText}}</td><td>{{capability}}<p>{{remedy}}</p>{{#if recoveryValue}}<div class="hol-tool-progress"><progress value="{{progress}}" max="{{recoveryValue}}"></progress><span>{{progress}} / {{recoveryValue}}</span></div>{{/if}}</td><td>{{#if canTreat}}<button type="button" data-action="treatment" data-event-id="{{eventId}}">Treat</button>{{/if}}<a href="#" data-hol-rule-path="design/rules/wounds.md">Details</a></td></tr>{{#if treating}}<tr><td colspan="4"><p>After eligible treatment and its printed activity time, record the outcome. Scars remain.</p><div class="hol-tool-actions"><button type="button" data-action="treat" data-event-id="{{eventId}}" data-steps="1">1 progress</button><button type="button" data-action="treat" data-event-id="{{eventId}}" data-steps="2">2 progress</button><button type="button" data-action="treat" data-event-id="{{eventId}}" data-steps="3">3 progress</button></div></td></tr>{{/if}}{{else}}<tr><td colspan="4">No applied wound records.</td></tr>{{/each}}</tbody></table><button type="button" data-action="wounds">Record or manage wounds</button></section>{{/if}}
{{#if owner}}<details class="hol-tool-box"><summary>Correct a mistake</summary><button type="button" data-action="operation" data-kind="correct">Correct health and survival</button>{{#if gm}}{{#if pendingDeath}}<p>An unresolved death roll needs its original retained dice; no new roll will be made.</p><label>Three retained death dice<input name="deathFaces" placeholder="2, 4, 6"></label><label>Note (optional)<input name="deathReason"></label><button type="button" data-action="recoverDeath">Record recovered death result</button>{{/if}}{{/if}}</details>{{/if}}
</div></section>
